      "chunk_text": "Rohan Deshmukh contacted insurance agent Anjali Desai to discuss his auto insurance policy (AU-4521), which had expired on 15/09/2026. After learning about the standard renewal cost of \u20b912,500 and inquiring about discounts, Rohan qualified for a 5% safe driver discount, lowering the total to \u20b911,875. Rohan decided to proceed with the renewal, and Anjali agreed to send the renewal invoice via email.",
